      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "In this section you cover:\n• Aorist infinitives, first and second, active and middle\n• Aspect in the infinitive\n• Aorist imperatives, first and second, active and middle\n• Present imperatives: εἰμί, εἶμι, οἶδα, δύναμαι, ἀνίσταμαι\n• ἔξεστι, δεινός\n• Vocatives\n• Adjectives: πᾶς",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
